    <section class="ev-section ev-methods" id="methods">
      <h2>Data &amp; methods</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Coverage</dt>
        <dd>Grand Finals 2016–2026 (no contest in 2020). 2016 is the first year with separate jury and televote scores.</dd>
        <dt>Source</dt>
        <dd>Eurovisionworld.com: results, bilateral points and running order.</dd>
        <dt>Cleaning</dt>
        <dd>Non-qualifiers removed from Final results; jury/televote columns re-aligned and checked against published totals; zero-point pairs restored from the full voter × entry grid.</dd>
        <dt>Methods</dt>
        <dd>Descriptive statistics, Negative Binomial regression, permutation tests, correspondence analysis, network analysis and intervention models.</dd>
        <dt>Tools</dt>
        <dd>Python (pandas, NumPy, SciPy, statsmodels, NetworkX), Plotly for the charts, Astro for this page.</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

